description:
This sets a default user-agent which can be overridden by `RS_USER_AGENT`.

```
# RS_USER_AGENT not set

> curl -fL -H "User-Agent: ${RS_USER_AGENT:-r-builds}" https://httpbin.org/headers
{
  "headers": {
    "Accept": "*/*", 
    "Host": "httpbin.org", 
    "User-Agent": "r-builds", 
  }
}

> wget -qO- --header "User-Agent: ${RS_USER_AGENT:-r-builds}" https://httpbin.org/headers
{
  "headers": {
    "Accept": "*/*", 
    "Host": "httpbin.org", 
    "User-Agent": "r-builds", 
  }
}

# RS_USER_AGENT set
> export RS_USER_AGENT="rsc-setup/098123 foo"

> curl -fL -H "User-Agent: ${RS_USER_AGENT:-r-builds}" https://httpbin.org/headers
{
  "headers": {
    "Accept": "*/*", 
    "Content-Length": "0", 
    "Host": "httpbin.org", 
    "User-Agent": "rsc-setup/098123 foo"
  }
}

> wget -qO- --header "User-Agent: ${RS_USER_AGENT:-r-builds}" https://httpbin.org/headers
{
  "headers": {
    "Accept": "*/*", 
    "Accept-Encoding": "identity", 
    "Content-Length": "0", 
    "Host": "httpbin.org", 
    "User-Agent": "rsc-setup/098123 foo"
  }
}

```
